    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Lufthansa First Class\nMenu",
      "Lufthansa First Class\nLufthansa First Class\nLunch\nHors d'oeuvre\nSevruga Malossol Caviar with Garnishes\nA medley of Halibut, Butterfish and Crayfish Tails,\naccompanied by a zesty Mango Chili Sauce\nPotato Terrine with Truffles\nand stuffed Quail served atop a Lentil Medley\nSalad Greens fresh from the market\nwith slices of hot smoked Breast of Duck and Balsamic Dressing\nSalad\nFrisée, Radicchio and Romaine Salad with julienned Carrot and Celery,\npresented with Sherry Vinaigrette or Yogurt Herb Dressing\nBread, Rolls, Toast and Butter\nEntrees\nFresh White Asparagus enhanced by Hollandaise Sauce,\naccompanied by Black Forest Ham, cooked Ham and herbed New Potatoes\nOcean fresh Halibut, Salmon and Red Snapper in a Saffron Broth,\noffered with Root Vegetables\nLoin of Lamb au Gratin topped with a Cheese and Sesame Crust,\ncomplemented by Vegetables and Angel Hair Pasta\nBreast of Guinea Hen served in a light Tarragon Crème\nwith Red and White Rice and Spring Carrots\nCheese and Dessert\nInternational Cheeses featuring Petit Pierre, fresh Goat Cheese,\nCastello Blue, Fontina and Columnier,\ngarnished with Grapes and French salted Butter\nPumpkin Seed Crème accented by Apricot Sauce\nStrawberry Tart with Whipped Cream\nPralinés\nSnack\nSandwich selection featuring\nPastrami, smoked Salmon\nand Bavarian Blue Cheese\nDinner\nCold Specialties\nSeafood Medley featuring Crawfish, Scallops and Jumbo Shrimp\ncomplemented by Olive Oil Lime Dressing\nRoulades with Beef and Turkey\nserved atop Orzo Pasta with Tomato Pesto\nTortelloni Pasta filled with Artichoke\npresented on savory Herb Sauce\nBread, Rolls and Butter\nEntrees\nMulticolored Gnocchi and Shiitake Mushrooms\nenhanced by Sage and freshly grated Parmesan\nTenderloin of Beef on a Rhubarb Ragoût,\naccompanied by herbed Dumplings\nDessert\nBanana Mousse and Chocolate Mousse\ngarnished with shredded Coconut\nFresh Fruit\n120F002-C\n120F002-C\nEnglish\nEspañol\nGetränke\nBeverages"
    ],
